-- UNUSUAL LINE BREAK ----------------------------------------- main.kl  SEC0113

I found U+2028 (LINE SEPARATOR). Kalam lines end with LF, or with CRLF, which `kalam fmt` rewrites as LF.

2│     let name = "Sa ra"
                     ^

Try: `\u{2028}`

Help: Replace it with an ordinary line break (LF). Inside a string, write `\n` instead.

Learn more: kalam explain SEC0113
